{"page":206,"verses":[{"verse_key":"9:118","surah":9,"ayah":118,"ar_uthmani":"وَعَلَى ٱلثَّلَـٰثَةِ ٱلَّذِينَ خُلِّفُوا۟ حَتَّىٰٓ إِذَا ضَاقَتْ عَلَيْهِمُ ٱلْأَرْضُ بِمَا رَحُبَتْ وَضَاقَتْ عَلَيْهِمْ أَنفُسُهُمْ وَظَنُّوٓا۟ أَن لَّا مَلْجَأَ مِنَ ٱللَّهِ إِلَّآ إِلَيْهِ ثُمَّ تَابَ عَلَيْهِمْ لِيَتُوبُوٓا۟ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ هُوَ ٱلتَّوَّابُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"And to the three men who stayed behind: when the earth, for all its spaciousness, closed in around them, when their very souls closed in around them, when they realized that the only refuge from God was with Him, He turned to them in mercy in order for them to return [to Him]. God is the Ever Relenting, the Most Merciful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَعَلَى","en_gloss":"And on","transliteration":"waʿalā","verse_key":"9:118"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلثَّلَـٰثَةِ","en_gloss":"the three","transliteration":"l-thalāthati","verse_key":"9:118"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"9:118"},{"pos":4,"ar":"خُلِّفُوا۟","en_gloss":"were left behind","transliteration":"khullifū","verse_key":"9:118"},{"pos":5,"ar":"حَتَّىٰٓ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"9:118"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"9:118"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ضَاقَتْ","en_gloss":"(was) straitened","transliteration":"ḍāqat","verse_key":"9:118"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمُ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"ʿalayhimu","verse_key":"9:118"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضُ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍu","verse_key":"9:118"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"though","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"9:118"},{"pos":11,"ar":"رَحُبَتْ","en_gloss":"it was vast","transliteration":"raḥubat","verse_key":"9:118"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَضَاقَتْ","en_gloss":"And (was) straitened","transliteration":"waḍāqat","verse_key":"9:118"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"9:118